    "media:imagetext": "VARIGS NEW SUPER-G CONSTELLATION - latest\nand most luxurious transport serving the Three Americas\n- provides reclining seats, air-conditioned and pressurized\ncabin, plus VARIG's Continental cuisine and traditionally\nfine service for discriminating air travelers.\nEL NUEVO SUPER-G CONSTELLATION DE VARIG\n—el servicio de transporte más moderno y más lujoso que\n10\nsirve a las Tres Americas — con 3 cabinas presurisadas e\naire acondicionado, assientos \"siesta\"\n; \"lounge\" e bar, mas\nla cocina Continental \"VARIG\".\nO NOVO SUPER-G CONSTELLATION DA VARIG —\no mais moderno avião em servico entre as Três Americas\n—com 3 cabines pressurisadas e ar condicionado, assentos-\nleitos, \"lounge\" e bar, mais a cozinha continental \"VARIG\".\nPLACE\nSTAMP\nHERE\n2015,166.1718",
